						<IfcSimplePropertyTemplate id="i292" GlobalId="2BofA0qVyHuO00025QrE$V" Name="ClearWidth" Description="Actual clear width measured as the clear space for accessibility and egress; it is a measured distance betwen the two handrails or the wall and a handrail on a ramp.
