						<IfcSimplePropertyTemplate id="i294" GlobalId="2N7Ru0qVyHuO00025QrE$V" Name="CounterSlope" Description="Sloping angle of the object, measured perpendicular to the slope  - relative to horizontal (0.0 degrees). 
