						<IfcSimplePropertyTemplate id="i1024" GlobalId="38HE3MiubAze4HgMBTFG14" Name="ArrangementType" Description="Terminal box arrangement.
SingleDuct: Terminal box receives warm or cold air from a single air supply duct.
DualDuct: Terminal box receives warm and cold air from separate air supply ducts." TemplateType="p_enumeratedvalue" PrimaryMeasureType="IfcLabel">
